    {
     "title": "Second Patch",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’ve been hard at work expanding and refining Upin & Ipin Universe to make your adventures more exciting and smoother than ever. Patch 2 introduces brand-new content, important fixes, and long-awaited quality-of-life improvements. Here’s what’s new:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fresh Merdeka Content – Merdeka-themed decorations across Kampung Durian Runtuh and Firework Celebration by Tok Dalang.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Streamer Mode – Added a Streamer Mode under the Gameplay Settings.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gameplay Fixes – From RC collisions to quest markers, we’ve addressed multiple issues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "UI Improvements – Cooking and Fishing activity UIs now function seamlessly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Quality-of-Life – Basic cooked dishes inventory added, improved save slots, and smoother quest flow.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "No matter how you play fishing, racing, cooking, or completing quests this update makes your journey better than ever.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please check out the full patch notes below.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45684481/8d79efca91639c6d2da59469a1d1218741008ae2.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
